DESCRIPTION:WE WILL ROCK YOU\, produced by Streva Productions and directed 
 by Jenny Ballard\, the worldwide smash-hit musical by Queen and Ben Elton 
 is coming to Acadiana Center for the Arts January 14-16 for four electrify
 ing performances! This multi- million dollar show dazzles all the senses i
 n breathtaking style. Guaranteed to blow your mind\, this global theatrica
 l masterpiece is not to be missed! We Will Rock You is a high-energy jukeb
 ox musical featuring the iconic songs of Queen\, set in a dystopian future
  where a powerful corporation has outlawed individuality and live music. W
 hen a group of rebellious outsiders known as the Bohemians rise up against
  the conformist regime of the Killer Queen\, two young misfits—Galileo a
 nd Scaramouche—embark on a quest to rediscover real rock music and the f
 reedom it represents. Packed with humor\, heart\, and legendary anthems li
 ke “Bohemian Rhapsody\,” “We Will Rock You\,” “Under Pressure\,
 ” “Another One Bites the Dust\,” “We Are the Champions\,” and ma
 ny other Queen classics\, the show celebrates self-expression\, community\
 , and the enduring power of rock ’n’ roll. Dates & Times: Thursday\, 1
 /14/2027 7:00–9:45pm Friday\, 1/15/2027 7:00–9:45pm Saturday\, 1/16/20
